Source: scriptures
Section: python
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Reuben Institute <reubeninstitute@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2

Package: python3-scriptures
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-pandas, python3-hebrew, scriptures-data
Description: Hebrew scripture text classes (Bible, Mishnah, Talmud, Zohar)
 Provides Scriptures, Bible, Mishnah, TalmudBavli, TalmudYerushalmi,
 Zohar, ZoharChadash and ZoharTikkunim classes for Reuben Institute's
 Hebrew text corpus, with a bundled web viewer available separately.

Package: scriptures-data
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3
Description: Hebrew scripture text data (Bible, Mishnah, Talmud, Zohar)
 Provides the JSON text database for Reuben Institute's Hebrew text
 corpus, sourced from Sefaria (https://sefaria.org).

Package: scriptures-web
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-flask, python3-scriptures, fonts
Description: Web viewer for Reuben Institute's scripture corpus
 Flask app serving the Hebrew scripture texts in the browser.
